Congratulations on reaching Minetown at XP level 1, that is a challenge
in and of itself!

I'm sure someone else will point you towards one of the great
FAQ/spoilers regarding credit cloning but the basic idea is that
dropping money in a store gives you credit with which you can purchase
items from same store.  So, with the credit that you created you buy
more stuff (with the credit, not with the zorkmids that you're holding)
and then sell it right back for cash.  Then you must rely on your pet
to pick up the zorkmids that you dropped and bring it to you outside of
the store or ito the first space inside the door.  Obviously this
process is much easier with a leash or magic whistle and having some
tripe rations in your inventory can help speed things up.  Repeat that
process ad nauseum until the shopkeeper is broke.  Be sure to watch
your nutrition while you're doing this as it can take a while,
especially if you are starting with a small amount of credit.

